  random numbers are generated, the state of the generator will change. For
  example:

  >>> g = tf.random.Generator.from_seed(1234)
  >>> g.state
  <tf.Variable ... numpy=array([1234,    0,    0])>
  >>> g.normal(shape=(2, 3))
  <...>
  >>> g.state
  <tf.Variable ... numpy=array([2770,    0,    0])>

